{"nodes":[{"id":"title00000000001","type":"text","text":"# 98种流行女性刘海｜真实参考 Canvas\n\n**当前进度：01/14 批｜7/98**\n\n工作顺序：真实行业名称 → 真实参考图 → 结构差异 → 十元映射。\n\n本批主题：空气／透薄刘海家族。图片来自公开美发资料页，用作视觉研究与分类参考，不冒充原创图。","x":-420,"y":-620,"width":840,"height":360,"color":"4"},{"id":"group0000000001","type":"group","label":"批次01｜空气／透薄刘海家族｜7种","x":-1900,"y":-120,"width":3800,"height":1500,"color":"4"},{"id":"card00000000001","type":"text","text":"## 01｜透视齐刘海\n### See-Through Fringe\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/3-eyebrow-skimming-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=881%2C1140&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：齐眉水平边缘＋降低密度，额头可见。\n\n**主十元**：zn　**副十元**：xn\n**体量**：4　**纯度**：76%\n**五维**：本体／时间\n\n**区别**：比厚齐刘海更轻，比普通空气刘海保留更明确的齐线。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-1760,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"6"},{"id":"card00000000002","type":"text","text":"## 02｜轻羽碎刘海\n### Wispy Bangs\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/4-wispy-korean-bangs-for-long-hair.jpg?resize=830%2C1032&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：发束细、稀疏、长短不齐，接近眼睛。\n\n**主十元**：zn　**副十元**：xz\n**体量**：4　**纯度**：73%\n**五维**：本体／命运\n\n**区别**：核心不是“透”而是边缘羽化与不整齐的碎束。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-1240,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"6"},{"id":"card00000000003","type":"text","text":"## 03｜两层透视刘海\n### Two-Tier Fringe\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/5-see-through-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=806%2C953&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：中央短透层＋两侧更长弯曲侧束。\n\n**主十元**：n　**副十元**：zn\n**体量**：5　**纯度**：78%\n**五维**：空间／本体\n\n**区别**：有明确双层结构，不只是单层稀薄刘海。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-720,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"3"},{"id":"card00000000004","type":"text","text":"## 04｜标准空气刘海\n### Airy Bangs\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/8-airy-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=828%2C915&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：覆盖眉部但保留透额缝隙，分布较均匀。\n\n**主十元**：zn　**副十元**：n\n**体量**：3　**纯度**：84%\n**五维**：本体／空间\n\n**区别**：比轻羽碎刘海更整齐，比透视齐刘海更柔和。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-200,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"6"},{"id":"card00000000005","type":"text","text":"## 05｜Baby空气刘海\n### Baby Bangs\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/9-long-asian-hairstyle-with-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=796%2C1031&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：少量细束贴近发际线，中央偏短。\n\n**主十元**：zn　**副十元**：z\n**体量**：2　**纯度**：70%\n**五维**：本体／时间\n\n**区别**：长度和发量都小于标准空气刘海，接近胎毛感。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":320,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"6"},{"id":"card00000000006","type":"text","text":"## 06｜Peekaboo透薄刘海\n### Peekaboo Bangs\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/10-thin-korean-bangs-for-round-faces.jpg?resize=684%2C766&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：中央透薄，侧束明显分开，额头若隐若现。\n\n**主十元**：x并z　**副十元**：zn\n**体量**：4　**纯度**：68%\n**五维**：空间／本体\n\n**区别**：遮挡与露出并存，重点是“窥视式”间隙。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":840,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"5"},{"id":"card00000000007","type":"text","text":"## 07｜极薄隐形刘海\n### Subtle / Barely-There Bangs\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/16-barely-there-wispy-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=895%2C1085&ssl=1)\n\n**结构**：中央发束极少，两侧稍多，接近没有刘海。\n\n**主十元**：nx　**副十元**：zn\n**体量**：2　**纯度**：79%\n**五维**：因果／本体\n\n**区别**：比Baby刘海更长，但视觉存在感更低，主动退让额头空间。\n\n[来源文章](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":1360,"y":40,"width":480,"height":1120,"color":"1"},{"id":"source000000001","type":"text","text":"## 本批来源与判定说明\n\n- The Right Hairstyles：**16 Trendy Ways to Wear Korean Bangs**\n- Hair.com by L’Oréal：**Korean Air Bangs Are the Low-Maintenance Way to Try Bangs**\n\nHair.com 将 air bangs 说明为极薄、分束、位于眉毛与睫毛之间的刘海，并指出其也常被称作 Korean air bangs 或 see-through bangs。\n\n因此本批不是7个完全无关的基础类型，而是同一家族中的：**齐线、碎束、双层、标准、短化、窥视、极薄**七种结构变体。","x":-640,"y":1480,"width":1280,"height":480,"color":"4"}],"edges":[{"id":"edge00000000001","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000001","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000002","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000003","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000003","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000004","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000004","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000005","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000005","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000006","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000006","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000007","fromNode":"title00000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"card00000000007","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edge00000000008","fromNode":"card00000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"source000000001","toSide":"top"}]}